&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Role: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Director of Social &amp;amp; Creator – Dove Social Studios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; London (Global remit), 2–3 days per week &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;role is on the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Dove Social Studio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; always-on content &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; social engine &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;spanning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; 15 markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;. It drives social-first excellence for one of the world’s most iconic, purposeful brands, connecting Dove’s values with audiences through culture, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;creativity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to shape how Dove connects with millions of people globally &amp;amp; define best-in-class social for both the brand &amp;amp; the industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;As Director of Social &amp;amp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Creators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;, you will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;set&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;global&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; standard for how Dove shows up &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;on social &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;inspire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; a multi-market team to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;continually &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;raise the bar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting on the client Global Leadership Team, you&#39;ll define how one of the world&#39;s most iconic brands shows up on social — and lead the multi-market team that delivers it. You&#39;ll oversee social media managers, creator leads, and senior social experts across markets, building capability, setting standards, and driving a programme that is native to platform, culture, and audience. As the senior social adviser to the client&#39;s global team, you&#39;ll translate platform expertise into confident, clear strategic direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Platform Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define global social frameworks, standards, and best practice across client Social Studios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify platform opportunities, cultural moments, and emerging formats — and translate them into clear strategic action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the studio&#39;s social authority, championing platform-native thinking across creative and content output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creator &amp;amp; Influencer Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the client&#39;s end-to-end creator and influence programme — from strategy design through to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the programme in line with audience behaviour, platform developments, and brand values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee creator managers and a large UGC network, maintaining creative quality, brand alignment, and scalable delivery&lt;/li&gt;
